unt-with-just-two-permits/articleshow/132606207.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-24T19:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132607023,imgsize-80650.cms"/></item></channel></rss>